                                                "text": "If I should hold that miscegeny is bestial and a heinous crime I would be prejudiced for I would be deliberately overlooking all the resemblances between the colored and white races."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5261f97-dbc4-40fe-8482-11886861dccb",
                                                "sense_id": "f1deb930-7eff-31f8-971b-c86076545189",
                                                "text": "In her sanctuary in El Cobre near Santiago, the skin tone of la Virgen is mulatto (a child of miscegeny)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
